OL,3,GNEWSATeen 'inspiring others'
OL,4,Acongratulated by Prince Harry
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Kent schoolboy with a rare genetic
OL,7,Fcondition has been honoured by Prince
OL,8,FHarry with a national award for his
OL,9,Fefforts to improve disabled children's
OL,10,Flives.
OL,12,FThe WellChild Awards, running for the
OL,13,F21st year, celebrate the achievements
OL,14,Fof seriously ill children, young people
OL,15,Fand their carers.
OL,17,FGeorge, who has spinal muscular atrophy
OL,18,F(SMA) Type 2, has campaigned and
OL,19,Fprotested alongside the SMA community
OL,20,Ffor greater inclusion and
OL,21,Faccessibility, helping to shape NHS
OL,22,Fdecision-making.
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
