OL,3,GNEWSATeen 'inspiring others'
OL,4,Acongratulated by Prince Harry
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I am incredibly proud of my son
OL,7,FGeorge," his mother, Lucy Frost, said.
OL,8,F"George has achieved so much at such a
OL,9,Fyoung age, using his experiences and
OL,10,Fvoice to create positive change and
OL,11,Finspire others."
